Package: rvtk
Title: Bindings for the Visualization Toolkit ('VTK')
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
        given = "Aymeric",
        family = "Stamm",
        role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
        email = "aymeric.stamm@cnrs.fr",
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8725-3654")
    ))
Description: Makes the Visualization Toolkit ('VTK') available to R packages
    so their C++ code can link against it without requiring users to install
    'VTK' manually. When no suitable system installation is found, pre-built
    static libraries are downloaded automatically. Downstream packages declare
    'Imports: rvtk' and obtain the correct compiler and linker flags at
    install time from CppFlags(), LdFlags(), and LdFlagsFile(); the use_rvtk()
    helper writes all required build-time files in one step. Pre-built
    libraries cover all VTK modules that can be built without external
    dependencies, and downstream packages can opt in to linking only the
    modules they need.
